))\\,j=-2\\,i+j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we draw the vectors starting at the corresponding points and obtain the following diagram:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14044724/assets/2595c11a1b30fee9d76028010d2c7e608250c0d48ce0191d7da2a5412af6a110.png)" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323798 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323799 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323800 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323801 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323802 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1041 "selection" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1104 #edb/ref 17592186323801 13194139534972 true] [17592186323797 1110 #uuid "f7562ddb-6882-5063-a19d-c44e6874ae0b" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323798 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14044724/assets/135122e85da455699e45c1e276152b20fee0ac9d18441eb5620b1aa43654c81b.png" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323798 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534972 true] [17592186323798 1111 #uuid "8cfb882f-61ae-5fcb-b39f-f56482f72c48" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323799 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14044724/assets/3bf6311586ae40bb490414108bbf232f40e1e727da45bbdbe3123e60c17f6268.png" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323799 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534972 true] [17592186323799 1111 #uuid "ff5b8f09-fc3a-5da3-b2ac-c024251d6116" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323800 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14044724/assets/716f99a985d8b4909e76f922fc3bf5b3350f9cb7496ae0a0a429421016a19267.png" 13194139534972 true] [17592186323800 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534972 true] [1